        "TileImage": "$($repository 005e3ab8-508c-471b-8426-53aca5c6ef4b).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening, 47. Dino Bosco, acclaimed actor and current star of L&apos;aaventura&apos;s The Icon is unimpressed with the &quot;Work Ethos&quot; around the site. There appears to be numerous staff members disrespecting him. He wants them all gone. Lastly, The Icon&apos;s suit is supposed to be bulletproof, he would like you to test that. He has a body double acting for him but the suit is real. He doesn&apos;t mind collateral damage because they aren&apos;t trying hard enough and the show must go on. Good Luck, 47.",
